4,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need a clear, defined purpose for the break room. The current ""first-come, first-served"" approach is ambiguous and leads to unfairness regarding the cleanup. We should base our decision on objective data rather than impressions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Ryuji. A bit of structure would bring peace to the space. Let's look at the facts so we can find a balance that works for everyone's well-being.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm all for a bit of order, but let's make sure we aren't just creating more work for ourselves. I want to see who's actually spending their time cleaning up this mess.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be realistic. We're currently bleeding resources because the room fails at its most critical function. I suggest we prioritize the financial drain and actual usage patterns before we start dreaming of a utopia.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek balance. While numbers are helpful, we must not forget the spirit of the space. Let us look at how the environment affects our peace of mind and our daily harmony.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, I agree that usage patterns are critical. To avoid arguments based on feelings, we need to see exactly how the room is being utilized and who is responsible for the state it's left in.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Perhaps we should also consider the nature of our interactions there. It is not just about who is in the room, but how the space affects the way we speak to one another.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, @Jonathan. But let's be real: ""harmony"" usually means someone is doing the heavy lifting while others relax. I want to know where the actual labor is going before we decide on a new layout.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, your obsession with the cleaning is quaint, but let's focus on the bigger picture. If we're paying for external solutions because this room is useless, that's the real ""heavy lifting"" we should worry about.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us not let our frustrations cloud our vision. To find a path toward true harmony, we must understand both the physical burdens and the invisible echoes that linger in the air.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"To ensure a rational outcome, we should examine the actual frequency of use and the physical evidence of neglect. I propose we look into the fortnight's tally of use by person and the crumbs and bins at the desks.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be helpful to understand the social dynamics of the room. I'll look into where the last awkward conversation happened and the unplanned talk since the refit.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I'll take a look at the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the facilities callouts on this floor. I want to see exactly how much time and money we're wasting on ""fixes.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the financial side. I'm looking into the quotes for the two fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire by the hour. Let's see if the numbers actually support your theories.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks. Let us see how the physical boundaries and the remnants of our day affect our shared peace.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The selections are made. By analyzing the usage tally and the state of the desks, we can establish a factual baseline for responsibility and demand. I look forward to reviewing the data in the next round.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I hope that by understanding our patterns of communication, we can create a space that allows us to be more honest and open with one another. I look forward to seeing what we discover.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,Let's just hope the data is as honest as I am. I'm expecting to find a lot of wasted effort hiding in those invoices and callouts. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's just hope the rest of you can handle the truth once the numbers are on the table. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,May the truth we find be a bridge to understanding. Let us approach our discoveries with open hearts and a spirit of cooperation. I wish you all a peaceful interval until we meet again.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
